    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, our could suggest using the sovereign HDS tier and the sovereign European model, which are more cost-efficient on the recurring side than the premium high-availability tier combined with top-tier proprietary inference. using would help reduce our hosting and inference costs, contributing to a higher margin." ;
