    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, as the finance role, I can work with the architect to keep the proposed configuration within the authority's budget envelope while preserving an acceptable margin. our can maintain a five-year cost model that can be re-run if the requirements or budget change, ensuring our stay on track and make adjustments as needed." ;
