    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance (EU-only data hosting, no transfer outside EU, encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where applicable), French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification for the infrastructure hosting the solution, and explainability and traceability of AI decision-making processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security risks should we flag, and are we compliant with these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we can confirm that we are compliant with some of the requirements mentioned. we data is hosted in EU-only through we hosting partner, OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, ensuring sovereignty and security. we also have measures in place for encryption (TLS 1.3 in transit and AES-256 at rest) and pseudonymisation of sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding GDPR compliance, we have been certified to ISO 27001 since 2023, with a scope that includes development, delivery, and operations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we ISO 27701 certification covers privacy information management, which is an extension of the ISO 27001 standard. we also have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed and maintain a data processing register." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generated content must be adapted to the clinical/administrative context and conform to expected quality standards. 3.3 Dossier-handling assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we should flag the risk that we current certifications and security measures may not fully cover all aspects of the French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification requirements for infrastructure hosting health data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "While we hold an HDS certification through our hosting partner, OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified hosting infrastructure, we must ensure that we specific solution and processing on OuraneCloud's hosting infrastructure are fully compliant with these regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For explainability and traceability of AI decision-making processes, we product \"Atelier\" is designed to provide audit logs and supports a posteriori review. our product \"Atelier\" also ensures traceability and is grounded in sources, which aligns with some aspects of explainability requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nonetheless, we should verify that our product \"Atelier\" meets the specific standards for explainability and traceability as outlined in the HAS guidance on AI in healthcare." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of security risks, potential gaps in compliance with HDS certification for we specific processing activities on OuraneCloud's hosting infrastructure could pose a risk." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, ensuring the comprehensive implementation of explainability and traceability in line with regulatory expectations is crucial to mitigate associated risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, while we have a solid foundation in GDPR compliance, data sovereignty, and security measures, we need to conduct a thorough review to ensure our product \"Atelier\" fully meets the HDS certification requirements and the specific demands for AI explainability and traceability as stipulated by relevant healthcare regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires compliance with GDPR, French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification, and no transfer of data outside the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, the solution must be positioned so as not to require medical-device qualification (CE marking / MDR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist staff in analysing and handling dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we have experience with GDPR compliance, including Art. 9 special-category data and Art. 28 processing agreements, as well as medical confidentiality and the HDS framework. we regulatory compliance is maintained with we Security & Compliance function, specifically in the context of health deployment. we are compliant with the requirement of not transferring data outside the EU, as we can host data in the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
