    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an AI assistance solution that facilitates access to information, improves the quality of written outputs, and reduces processing and documentation times. an AI assistance solution that facilitates access to information, improves the quality of written outputs, and reduces processing and documentation times must provide explainable recommendations or suggestions and guarantee traceability of AI decision-making processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI capabilities can we propose to meet these requirements? we can propose we Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities, which generate answers from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus. our Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities, which generate answers from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus ensures that we responses are grounded in the organization's own validated documents, limiting unsupported generation.  we AI solution can assist with drafting clinical and administrative content, such as discharge summaries and medical reports, and provide information retrieval and drafting assistance to hospital staff. we can also offer template-guided drafting for various documents, including discharge summaries, medical correspondence, and administrative documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the need for explainable recommendations or suggestions, Our AI solution provides source citations, retrieved passages, and a retrieval trace, allowing for a posteriori audit. provides ensures that the AI decision-making process is transparent and traceable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must support medical coding (PMSI / ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Our AI solution can support continuity of care between professionals and services by providing structured handover summaries, enabling efficient resumption of handling by another professional. we can also assist with dossier handling, surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications. we approach is designed to fit into existing practices without introducing rupture in clinical or administrative workflows, and we can provide a non-decisional support tool that assists staff members in staff members daily activities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The client information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

