    <http://example.org/node/chunk153> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What sustainability measures can we propose to meet limit?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a CSR & Sustainability officer at we, I can propose that The proposed solution utilizes green hosting partners, such as OuraneCloud, which offers sovereign hosting in the EU, renewable energy, and a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2, indicating efficient energy use." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, OuraneCloud, which offers sovereign hosting in the EU heat reuse capability further reduces waste and environmental impact.  we can also highlight we digital sobriety practices, including model right-sizing, caching, and batching, which contribute to reducing energy consumption." ;
